- openai (OpenAI Node/JS SDK) — Apache License 2.0, Copyright OpenAI
- typebox — MIT License, Copyright (c) sinclairzx81
- partial-json — MIT License, Copyright (c) Muspi Merol

The shell backend (module :shell) bundles native code:

- BoringSSL (io.github.vvb2060.ndk:boringssl, statically linked into libadbpair
  for SPAKE2) — ISC License and OpenSSL License, Copyright The BoringSSL Authors
  and The OpenSSL Project
- Conscrypt (org.conscrypt:conscrypt-android) — Apache License 2.0,
  Copyright The Android Open Source Project

Its adb pairing and connection protocol follows the Android Open Source Project's
adb (packages/modules/adb), Apache License 2.0.

WeiAssist Gateway (module :gateway), a separate optional app, bundles magpie as
a program (lib/arm64-v8a/libmagpie.so), built from the pinned source in
magpie/upstream:

- magpie — https://github.com/yetone/magpie — MIT License, Copyright (c) 2026
  yetone. Its license and the notices of the software it compiles in ship in
  that app as assets/magpie/LICENSE and assets/magpie/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.

